  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance - Jamaica Emergency Communications System Modernization, through Winbourne Consulting, LLC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This technical assistance grant for the Ministry of Science, Energy and Technology provides funding support for the development of a modernized and unified emergency communications system in Jamaica. The project would include the creation of a consolidated emergency communications system at the national level, as well as implementation of technological and operational upgrades to improve the country&apos;s emergency response capabilities. This technical assistance would strengthen emergency response and communications capacity for disasters such as severe storms and hurricanes, which disproportionately affect Caribbean islands. Project implementation would provide commercial opportunities for U.S. companies to export goods and services related to emergency communications technologies and solutions.</narrative>
  </description>
